+
+## Verification commands and outputs
+
+- `test -f daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/replay_tests.rs`
+  - Exit code `0`
+- `test -f daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/corruption_tests.rs`
+  - Exit code `0`
+- `test -f daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/budget_tests.rs`
+  - Exit code `0`
+- `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-core --lib events::replay_tests`
+  - `4 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 260 filtered out`
+- `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-core --lib events::corruption_tests`
+  - `5 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 259 filtered out`
+- `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-core --lib events::budget_tests -- --include-ignored`
+  - `3 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 261 filtered out`
+- Extra verification: `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-daemon --lib rpc::event_capture_tests`
+  - `6 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 49 filtered out`
+
+### Budget artifacts
+
+- `daemon/target/event_budget/prepare_change.json`
+  - `p50=664us p95=801us p99=3710us payload_bytes=1514`
+- `daemon/target/event_budget/get_context_capsule.json`
+  - `p50=289us p95=353us p99=3314us payload_bytes=383`
+- `daemon/target/event_budget/prepare_change_spill.json`
